<title>CHILE: Chile court overturns Telex accounting fine.</title>
<headline>Chile court overturns Telex accounting fine.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Supreme Court on Wednesday accepted an appeal by Telex-Chile SA against a fine levied by the country's securities regulator for alleged inaccuracies in accounts submitted by its Chilesat division.</p>
<p>The decision left an earlier ruling in favour of the Stocks and Values Superintendency &quot;without effect,&quot; the court record said.</p>
<p>The authorities fined Telex and its auditors Price Waterhouse last year for allegedly misreporting Chilesat's earnings in 1993 and 1994.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
